<!-- OPTIONAL (Tier 2): the multilingual form is commented out below and ships INACTIVE. To
     activate, replace this whole <urlset> with the commented block — every language version is
     listed, and each entry repeats the full set of alternates including itself, the same rule
     as the hreflang tags in the pages. See "Activating the second language" in the README. -->
